{"id": "21-1731-2-4", "zh": "524.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1732-2-7", "zh": "ugghāṭana、ghaṭīyanta 指从井里汲水的辘轳；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1733-2-9", "zh": "mañjūsā、peḷā、piṭaka 指箱匣；pacchi（阴性）、peṭaka 指筐篮。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1734-2-4", "zh": "525.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1735-2-10", "zh": "byābhaṅgī（阴性）、kāja 指扁担；sikkā 指扁担两头挂东西的吊网。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1736-2-11", "zh": "upāhana 或 pādu（阴性）指鞋；鞋的一种叫 pādukā，是木屐。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1737-2-4", "zh": "526.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1738-2-8", "zh": "varattā、vaddhikā、naddhi 指皮带；bhastā 指皮囊。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1739-2-4", "zh": "熔炼金子等的坩埚叫 mūsā；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1740-2-6", "zh": "kūṭa 或 ayoghana 指铁锤。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1741-2-4", "zh": "527.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1742-2-8", "zh": "铁匠的工具：saṇḍāsa 是钳子，muṭṭhi 是锤子，adhikaraṇī（阴性）是铁砧；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1743-2-10", "zh": "铁匠的风箱叫 gaggarī（阴性）；satta 也叫 pipphala，是剪刀。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1744-2-4", "zh": "528.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1745-2-6", "zh": "sāṇa 又叫 nikasa，指磨刀石；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1746-2-5", "zh": "ārā 指穿孔用的锥子；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1747-2-10", "zh": "khara 和 kakaca（非阴性）指锯子；sippa 指技艺，即手艺、工巧之类。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1748-2-4", "zh": "529.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1749-2-7", "zh": "paṭimā、paṭibimba、bimba、paṭinidhi 指像、影像；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1750-2-8", "zh": "下列三性通用：paṭibhāga、sannikāsa、sarikkhaka，意为相似；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1751-2-4", "zh": "530.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1752-2-5", "zh": "samāna、sadisa、tulya、", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1753-2-5", "zh": "saṅkāsa、sannibha、nibha，也都是相似的意思；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1754-2-10", "zh": "opamma、upamāna 和 upamā 指譬喻；bhati 为阴性，指工钱。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1755-2-4", "zh": "531.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1756-2-9", "zh": "nibbesa、vetana、mūlya 指工钱；jūta（非阴性）、ketava 指赌博；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1757-2-10", "zh": "dhutta、akkhadhutta、kitava、jūtakāra、akkhadevin 指赌徒。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1758-2-4", "zh": "532.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1759-2-9", "zh": "pāṭibhoga、paṭibhū 指担保人；akkha、pāsaka 指骰子；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1760-2-21", "zh": "aṭṭhapada（复注与锡兰本作 aṭṭhāpada）只用阳性，指棋盘；棋盘上的棋子叫 sāri；paṇa、abbhuta 指赌注。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-1761-2-4", "zh": "533.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1762-2-10", "zh": "kiṇṇa 指酿酒的酒曲；madhu 用来指蜜酒；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1763-2-10", "zh": "madirā、vāruṇī、majja、surā 指酒；āsava、meraya 指酿造的酒。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "21-1764-2-4", "zh": "534.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1765-2-8", "zh": "saraka、casaka（非阴性）指酒杯；āpāna、pānamaṇḍala 指饮酒的场所。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1766-2-4", "zh": "535.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1767-2-9", "zh": "这里有些词，因为常用于某一性，就只按那一种性列出；", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-1768-2-9", "zh": "但由于它们具有同样的性质、也有别的用法，在其他性里也应当认得它们。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-1769-2-4", "zh": "首陀罗品到此结束。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1770-2-4", "zh": "四种姓品完毕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1771-2-4", "zh": "5. 森林品", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "21-1772-2-4", "zh": "536.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1773-2-9", "zh": "arañña、kānana、dāya、gahana、vipina、vana 指森林；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1774-2-12", "zh": "aṭavī 为阴性；大森林叫 mahārañña，也叫 araññānī，是阴性。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1775-2-4", "zh": "537.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1776-2-8", "zh": "离城不太远、由善人栽种的", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1777-2-9", "zh": "树林叫 ārāma，同样也叫 upavana。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1778-2-4", "zh": "538.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1779-2-9", "zh": "供众人共用的林苑，以及国王的林苑，叫 uyyāna；", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "21-1780-2-8", "zh": "同样的林苑，如果是专供后宫的，就叫 pamadavana。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1781-2-4", "zh": "539.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1782-2-13", "zh": "panti、vīthi、āvali、seṇī、pāḷi、lekhā、rāji 指行列；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1783-2-9", "zh": "pādapa、viṭapin、rukkha、aga、sāla、mahīruha 指树；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1784-2-4", "zh": "540.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1785-2-10", "zh": "duma、taru、kuja、sākhin 也指树；gaccha 指矮小的树，即灌木；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1786-2-10", "zh": "不开花就结果的树，叫 vanappati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1787-2-4", "zh": "541.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1788-2-4", "zh": "果实成熟之后", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1789-2-6", "zh": "就枯死的植物，叫 osadhi；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1790-2-11", "zh": "三性通用：vañcya、aphala 指不结果的；phalina、phalavant、phalin 指结果的。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1791-2-4", "zh": "542.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1792-2-9", "zh": "samphullita、vikaca、phulla、vikasita 指开了花的，三性通用；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1793-2-12", "zh": "sira、agga、sikhara（非阴性）指树梢；sākhā 又叫 latā，指树枝。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1794-2-4", "zh": "543.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1795-2-10", "zh": "dala、palāsa、chadana、paṇṇa、patta、chada 指叶子；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1796-2-9", "zh": "pallava 或 kisalaya 指嫩叶；刚冒出来的芽叫 aṅkura。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1797-2-4", "zh": "544.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1798-2-10", "zh": "makula 或 kuṭumala 指花蕾；khāraka 和 jālaka 指成簇的嫩芽；", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-1799-2-8", "zh": "kalikā、koraka（非阴性）指花苞；vaṇṭa 指连着花、果等的柄。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1800-2-4", "zh": "545.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1801-2-10", "zh": "pasava、kusuma、puppha 指花；parāga 指花上生出的粉，即花粉；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1802-2-10", "zh": "makaranda 被认为就是 madhu，指花蜜；thavaka 和 gocchaka 指花束、花簇。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1803-2-4", "zh": "546.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1804-2-9", "zh": "没成熟的果子叫 salāṭu，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1805-2-6", "zh": "成熟的果子叫 pakka；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1806-2-9", "zh": "瞻波迦、芒果等的花名与果名，用中性。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1807-2-4", "zh": "547.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1808-2-10", "zh": "但末利等指花时，以及稻谷指果实时，保留原来的性；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1809-2-12", "zh": "jambū（阴性）、jambava、jambu 指阎浮果；viṭapa、viṭabhī（阴性）指枝杈。", "confidence": 60}
